# Scope of Work

Development is ticket-driven; each ticket is an isolated unit of work. Implement only what the current ticket describes: no unrelated refactoring, no future requirements, no redesigns unless the ticket asks.

# Decision Hierarchy (when information conflicts)

Current ticket → existing architecture → existing code → this document → `.claude/rules/*` → engineering judgment. Never let a lower source override the ticket.

