# Required Workflow

Every ticket follows the same lifecycle: read it, discover existing code, plan, implement only the ticket scope, verify, update docs that drifted, then open a PR. Run tickets with `/ticket <id>`. Full lifecycle: [`rules/workflow.md`](.claude/rules/workflow.md).

