# Success Criteria (a ticket is complete only when)

The functionality is implemented and verified (`/verify` clean), scope was respected, existing code was reused where it fit, docs touched by the change are updated, assumptions are documented, and the work is on a branch with an open PR. When uncertain, prefer investigation over assumption.
